  "dispatch_pipeline": [
    "1. CLI parses transport flags and options",
    "2. CLI builds ExecutionPackage using descriptor-derived types",
    "3. CLI invokes Unified Ingress / Core execution entrypoint",
    "4. Core validates package and resolves target adapter via ExecutorRegistry",
    "5. Adapter translates package and dispatches to executor host",
    "6. Core projects CanonicalResult / status envelope to CLI",
    "7. CLI formats result (--json or human render) and maps to frozen exit code"
